BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Iván & Hadoum
DTSTART:20260514T213000Z
DTEND:20260514T232500Z
DTSTAMP:20260514T213000Z
UID:P0HDiJwcKC
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 103 mins (1h43m)\n\nAmid the sprawling greenhouses o
 f Almería\, trans man Iván and migrant Hadoum share an unexpected\, elec
 tric connection. But when Iván rises to become her boss\, passion collide
 s with power and prejudice\, revealing the fragile boundaries between love
 \, identity\, and class.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/ivan-and-hadoum\
 n\nEstimated start: 14:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
