DTEND:20260515T021500Z
DTSTAMP:20260515T003000Z
UID:jq0S1AJgYq
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 92 mins (1h32m)\n\nIn this humorous docu-comedy\, Ke
 yla Monterrose Mejia shines as the titular character Valentina\, a beleagu
 ered El Paso resident confronting city council in her campaign for local e
 conomic justice. Director Tatti Ribeiro scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://ww
 w.siff.net/festival/valentina\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Film Center (Fri 
 15 May\, 3:00 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 17:40
